   "top": {
    "HI, WE’RE MING LABS. We're a design and tech company that speaks all the jargon. But luckily, we speak human too. We design, we write code, and we love the business side of it all.": 1,
    "Mirage is an independent strategy, design and communications agency based in Berlin and Amsterdam. We offer a wide range of creative disciplines including branding, consulting and digital services.We are focused on creating meaningful brand experiences which seek to redefine the relation between endurance, impact and resonation. With an anticipating attitude, we prepare our clients for the future by delivering creative solutions that accelerate growth.Brand Identity / Design Systems / Communications / Packaging / Art Direction / Consulting / Graphic Design / Illustration / Digital Services / Marketing / Campaigns / Advertising / Naming / Strategy / Visual Language / Workshops / Content / Website Design & Development": 1,
    "Customer Experience - Enabled by Technology.Best Practices: Marketing meets Technology.Marketing und Technologie: zwei durch uns fusionierte Kerndisziplinen  mit dem Ziel, Ergebnisse im Marketing auf ein hheres Level zu heben, immer hher hinaus, bis zur Marktberlegenheit.Tagtglich stellen wir unsere bergreifenden Kompetenzen neu unter Beweis. Wir sind in der Lage, die Customer Journey entlang aller Touchpoints in vorher nie gekannter Weise zu perfektionieren. Bester Beweis, wie gut unser Alleinstellungsmerkmal funktioniert, sind die vielen dokumentierten Best Practices unserer Kunden.Wir begleiten Kunden aus allen Branchen und Unternehmensgrßen zum digitalen Erfolg: Ricoh, Max Bgl, HP, Vogelsang, Hoval, Knauf PFT, Deutsche Automobil Treuhand, ArcelorMittal, Grube.Best Practices: Marketing meets Technology.Marketing and technology: two core disciplines merged by us - with the goal of raising marketing results to a higher level, to the point of market superiority.Every day we prove our extensive competences anew. We are able to perfect the customer journey along all touchpoints in a special and unique way. The greatest proof of how well our unique selling proposition works are the many documented best practices of our customers.We accompany customers from all industries and company sizes to digital success: Ricoh, Max Bgl, HP, Vogelsang, Hoval, Knauf PFT, Deutsche Automobil Treuhand, ArcelorMittal, Grube.": 1,
    "Tinloof is a global web design and web development agency that designs and builds web apps and sites.With client bases in the UK, the USA, and across Europe, Tinloof's team works remotely to support businesses of all sorts.We use technologies like React, NextJS, TypeScript, and Sanity CMS to power fast and good looking products.We work with all kinds of companies, lately with a motor insurance, a marketing SaaS, and a high-end gallery.Performance, usability, SEO, and accessibility, are core elements our team focuses on to make projects outstanding.": 1,
    "Our experts build powerful no-code websites that take you from a simple startup to a profitable project.Launch and iterate faster with a dedicated team that works directly for your needs. We handle maintenance and R&D to let you focus on maximizing your business growth. Enjoy a great price, excellent results, and rapid project completion.We’re happy to point you in the right direction and find a way to add value to your startup. Let`s work!": 1,
    "No-nonsense websites. Digital marketing that pays for itself. Branding you can never unsee. We are a studio for digital transformation based in Prague and Berlin.Web DevelopmentFast, functional, future-proof websites and applications, made to spark actions, relentlessly focused on results. ": 1,
    "TechStrive digital marketing agency provides award-winning advertising solutions for businesses. We make sure that your business gets more customers and also sells more products by making a client winning strategy for your business. You can trust us to grow your business. We can assist you in different digital marketing services like SEO, SEA & PPC Services, Social Media, Email Marketing.": 1,
    "We are a UX/UI Design, Web & Mobile Product Development Agency, Build a lot of Digital Products since 2015...We have worked for brands like Autodesk, Princeton University, Currencyfair, Negotiation Experts, Vodafone, Trendway, MyStetho, Qatar Airlines, Citycrop, Standout Solar, Bajaex.": 1,
    "We’re a collective of designers, strategists, and developers committed to charming digital experiences and captivating brands. Our experience ranges from early-stage startups to global, industry-leading corporations.We believe that design-driven solutions help businesses solve their increasingly complex communication challenges. Whether it’s building a brand, designing a social campaign, or developing a website, our approach emphasises clarity and exceptional aesthetic quality.We see the role of designers as communicators and facilitators. We’re here to help you get messages across with proactive, well-researched solutions. You'll find no project or account managers to slow down our collaborationthe person doing the work is the same one you talk to, because each of us has a direct stake in making sure things turn out great. We want to see projects through, together.": 1,
    "We believe the best ideas emerge when we work together. We look to our diverse range of skills to find solutions, knowing meaningful change starts with fresh thinking. That's why we brought a multidisciplinary team of thinkers and creators with design, innovation, marketing, and technology backgrounds together to serve our clients.": 1
